       --== Nopoll: a websocket toolkit ==--

--== Introduction ==--

See http://www.aspl.es/nopoll

--== Origin of this repository ==--

This is a copy of the noPoll websocket toolkit from Advanced Software
Production Line, S.L. (ASPL) (http://www.aspl.es/nopoll/,
https://github.com/ASPLes/nopoll), version 0.4.4 (0.4.4.b349), with
modifications by Comcast Cable Communications Management, LLC,
incorporating further noPoll updates to version 0.4.6 (0.4.6.b400).

History:

  * Comcast forked upstream ASPLes/nopoll (master) at commit
    d8da6ec3527ee3fadcce04dd145f257417fffc5b (Jun 9, 2017, upstream
    release tag 0.4.4, version 0.4.4.b349) and began making changes on the "nopoll_yocto" branch
    of https://github.com/xmidt-org/nopoll in July 2017.

  * Upstream release 0.4.5 (commit
    39dc2e1c7db4f5a0d889f0e317c877ad4a0d7276, Aug 21, 2017) was merged
    into the fork in January 2018.

  * Upstream release 0.4.6 (commit
    5cf7c10c3b0b758ad254504bf0ae7e600b118528, Mar 1, 2018) was
    incorporated into the fork in May 2018. No later upstream releases
    (0.4.7 onwards) have been incorporated.

  * The xmidt-org/nopoll "nopoll_yocto" branch was copied as-is into
    https://github.com/rdkcentral/nopoll (commit
    41f9cd37cf3bf657a598e2330d99aad316f8d0dd).

The following files were added by Comcast and are derived from
third-party code under their own (non-LGPL) licenses, as stated in each
file's header:

  * src/nopoll_hostcheck.[ch], src/nopoll_strcase.[ch],
    src/nopoll_inet_pton.h  - curl, (C) 1998-2017 Daniel Stenberg et al.
  * src/nopoll_inet_pton.c  - BIND 4.9.4, (C) 1996 Internet Software
                              Consortium (ISC license)
  * src/nopoll_hostname_validation.[ch] - (C) 2012 iSEC Partners (MIT)

noPoll is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1;
see the COPYING file.

--== Linking requirement ==--

Users of noPoll should link to it dynamically (as a shared library),
not statically. To build only the shared library:

    ./configure --disable-static --enable-shared
